        holding values like "secret-free" per SecretFreeMarker.CredentialModeSecretFree —
        NOT a secret material carrier; analog of the day-1 KeyVaultSecretRef.SecretName
        exclusion). Rationale: POML's Path C was authored without knowledge of the
        existing Path A precedent (2026-08-27 addition of SolutionVerificationRequest
        explicitly cited "looks like an oversight" that structurally identical siblings
        were excluded but it wasn't — same oversight pattern reproduced here).

